| `title` | `string` | Required | Article title |
| `image` | `string` | Required | Full-bleed image URL |
| `description` | `string` | — | Short excerpt |
| `imageAlt` | `string` | `title` | Meaningful image alt text |
| `date` | `string` | — | Formatted date |
| `datetime` | `string` | — | ISO date for `<time>` |
| `author` | `Author` | — | Author name and avatar |
| `ctaText` | `string` | `"Read more"` | CTA label; empty string hides it |
| `className` | `string` | — | Additional CSS classes |
| `variant` | `"default" \| "compact"` | `"default"` | Card size |

## Semantic hints

`card`, `article-card`, `preview`, `teaser`, `post-card`, `blog-card`, `article-preview`, `content-card`

## Implementation

Use one React Router `Link`; the CTA is text, not a nested button. Keep the full-bleed image beneath a bottom-dark gradient and bottom-aligned content. Maintain readable contrast, visible keyboard focus, and a subtle hover shadow. Compact cards use reduced padding and a 4:3 ratio.

```tsx
import { Link } from "react-router";
import type { ReactElement } from "react";

type Author = {
  name: string;
  avatar: string;
};

type ArticleCardProps = {
  href: string;
  title: string;
  image: string;
  description?: string;
  imageAlt?: string;
  date?: string;
  datetime?: string;
  author?: Author;
  ctaText?: string;
  className?: string;
  variant?: "default" | "compact";
};

export function ArticleCard({
  href,
  title,
  image,
  description,
  imageAlt = title,
  date,
  datetime,
  author,
  ctaText = "Read more",
  className,
  variant = "default",
}: ArticleCardProps): ReactElement {
  return (
    <article className={className}>
      <style>{`
        [data-cf-article-card] {
          position: relative;
          display: flex;
          align-items: flex-end;
          overflow: hidden;
          color: white;
          background: black;
          text-decoration: none;
        }
        [data-cf-article-card]:hover {
          box-shadow: 0 4px 12px #0006;
        }
        [data-cf-article-card]:focus-visible {
          outline: 3px solid currentColor;
          outline-offset: 3px;
        }
      `}</style>
      <Link
        to={href}
        data-cf-article-card=""
        style={{ aspectRatio: variant === "compact" ? "4 / 3" : "16 / 9" }}
      >
        <img
          src={image}
          alt={imageAlt}
          style={{
            position: "absolute",
            inset: 0,
            width: "100%",
            height: "100%",
            objectFit: "cover",
          }}
        />
        <div
          style={{
            position: "relative",
            width: "100%",
            padding: variant === "compact" ? "1rem" : "1.5rem",
            background: "linear-gradient(transparent, #000)",
          }}
        >
          {date && <time dateTime={datetime}>{date}</time>}
          <h2>{title}</h2>
          {description && <p>{description}</p>}
          {author && (
            <p>
              <img src={author.avatar} alt="" width={32} height={32} />
              {" "}{author.name}
            </p>
          )}
          {ctaText && <span>{ctaText}</span>}
        </div>
      </Link>
    </article>
  );
}
```

