# HeroSection

## Purpose
Reusable page hero for React Router 7 listing, category, and index routes. Displays a title, optional description, and optional content. Use `ArticleHeroHeader` for individual articles.

## Props
| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `title` | `string` | Required | Main heading text |
