`summary`, `key-facts`, `tldr`, `highlights`, `overview`, `key-points`, `summary-box`, `takeaways`

## React Router Implementation
`app/articles/ArticleSummaryCard.tsx`

SSR-compatible React Router 7 component; no client directive, loader, or action is needed. The default export is a runnable example when registered as a route module.

```tsx
import { useId } from "react";
import type { ReactElement } from "react";

type SummaryItem = {
  label: string;
  description: string;
};

type SummaryData = {
  heading?: string;
  intro?: string;
