# ArticleResourceDownload

Promotes PDFs, templates, and guides with a subtle gradient, document previews, eyebrow, title, description, and download CTA. Place mid-article after establishing value.

## Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `topic` | `string` | Required | Topic used in the default title |
| `title` | `string` | `"{topic} Checklist & Notes"` | Custom title |
| `description` | `string` | See code | Custom description |
| `buttonLabel` | `string` | `"Download Checklist (PDF)"` | Button text |
| `buttonHref` | `string` | `"#"` | Download URL; supply a real resource URL in production |
| `eyebrow` | `string` | `"Free download"` | Text above title |
| `className` | `string` | — | Additional container classes |
| `previewImages` | `string[]` | — | Document preview URLs; first two displayed |

## Semantic Hints

`resource-cta`, `download-cta`, `pdf-cta`, `guide-cta`, `lead-magnet`, `gated-content`, `resource-download`

## Implementation

`app/articles/ArticleResourceDownload.tsx`

Use React Router’s `Link` with `reloadDocument` so downloads bypass client-side routing. Same-origin files support the browser’s `download` attribute; cross-origin downloads may require server response headers. No loader, action, or client-only directive is needed.

```tsx
import { Link } from "react-router";

type ArticleResourceDownloadProps = {
  topic: string;
  title?: string;
  description?: string;
  buttonLabel?: string;
  buttonHref?: string;
  eyebrow?: string;
  className?: string;
  previewImages?: string[];
};

export default function ArticleResourceDownload({
  topic,
  title,
  description = "Download a practical checklist and notes to support your next steps.",
  buttonLabel = "Download Checklist (PDF)",
  buttonHref = "#",
  eyebrow = "Free download",
  className = "",
  previewImages = [],
}: ArticleResourceDownloadProps) {
  return (
    <section
      data-cf-resource-download=""
      className={`relative isolate overflow-hidden rounded-xl p-6 ${className}`}
      style={{
        background: "linear-gradient(135deg, #eef2ff, #fff)",
        color: "#172554",
      }}
    >
      <div
        aria-hidden="true"
        className="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10 blur-3xl"
        style={{
          background: "radial-gradient(circle at 90% 10%, #c7d2fe, transparent 60%)",
        }}
      />
      <div className="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-8">
        <div className="min-w-0 flex-1">
          <span className="text-sm uppercase">{eyebrow}</span>
          <h3 className="text-2xl font-bold">
            {title ?? `${topic} Checklist & Notes`}
          </h3>
          <p className="my-4 max-w-prose">{description}</p>
          <Link
            to={buttonHref}
            reloadDocument
            download
            className="inline-block rounded border px-4 py-3 font-bold shadow transition-transform hover:scale-105 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-4 motion-reduce:transform-none"
          >
            {buttonLabel}
          </Link>
        </div>
        <div aria-hidden="true" className="flex gap-2">
          {[0, 1].map((index) => (
            <div
              key={index}
              className="w-24 rounded border bg-white p-2 shadow"
              style={{ transform: `rotate(${index === 0 ? -3 : 3}deg)` }}
            >
              {previewImages[index] ? (
                <img src={previewImages[index]} alt="" />
              ) : (
                <div className="h-32">Checklist &amp; Notes</div>
              )}
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
